<Project>

    <!--
      Intentionally empty and intentionally not importing the repository root file.

      MSBuild stops walking up at the first Directory.Build.props, so this shields the tooling
      under build/ from the settings that source/ needs: x64, Revit vendor identity, central
      package management. RefCheck and BHS.Revit.Sdk are plain net10.0 / net48 projects that
      must keep building on their own - the SDK in particular has to build before anything
      else can restore.

      If something here ever needs a shared setting, add it to this file rather than removing it.
    -->

</Project>
